    "user_request_original": "Optimize a 29-layer planar multilayer thin-film stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), HfO2 (29 film layers total). Optimize all 29 individual layer thicknesses using L-BFGS quasi-Newton optimizer for 150 fixed iterations. Thickness perturbation bounds: ±2.5 nm from current best candidate thicknesses. Spectral targets: maximize transmittance 255-280 nm, minimize transmittance 300-700 nm, minimize transmittance 700-1100 nm. No metal layers. Materials: hfo2, MgF2 (Rodriguez-de_Marcos), SiO2 (Gao) substrate. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, thicknesses_nm for each round.",
